 rising from the ground and obscuring part of the view, creating a hazy, dreamlike effect. This mist not only adds to the mystery but also suggests a hot tub or sauna. The primary light source is artificial lighting fixtures above and to the sides, with a warm yellow to amber hue. A continuous strip of light along the lower part of the wall serves as supplementary lighting, illuminating the wall texture and the area around the figures. The mirror in the background is also softened, only a blurry reflection is visible—in which another person can be vaguely seen taking a photo with their phone. Beside the bed is a dark brown marble countertop covered with finely textured grains; the surface appears very smooth and cold. To the left is a circular metal drain cover. In the center is a recessed washbasin and its matching faucet, its shape still discernible although out of focus.The entire space employs a dark color scheme, such as black tiled corner moldings paired with light beige decorative panels, enhancing privacy and a sense of sophistication. The low-angle shots make the figures stand out more prominently and create a more imposing atmosphere. The technique of using a lot of out-of-focus shots keeps the foreground figures sharp and clear, while the mirrored surfaces and other objects in the background gradually become distorted and faded, thus guiding the viewer's attention to the main character.", 0, 1000, ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "提示词", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "起始索引"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "最大行数"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [461.83660888671875, 729.433837890625], "pos": [1154.23291015625, 278.7193298339844], "id": 29, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a